<p>Hey <%= @user.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>
  “<%= @app_name %>” was just connected to your Dabble Me account
  (<%= @user.email %>). It can read your journal entries and create new ones
  until you remove it. If this was you, you can ignore this message.
</p>

<% if @redirect_host.present? %>
  <p>
    This app signs in through <strong><%= @redirect_host %></strong><%= " (unverified app)" unless @verified %>.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  If you did not connect this app, remove it from
  <%= link_to "Connected apps", security_url(anchor: "connected-apps") %>
  and <%= link_to "change your password", edit_user_registration_url %>
  right away.
</p>

<p>
  <br>
  Thanks,
  <br>
  Dabble Me
</p>
